  "sourceTitle": "Mexican Salsa Dip",
  "sourceText": "Mexican Salsa Dip\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 19, 2009 - 12:01am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 can Chopped olives\n1 can Chopped Ortega green chilis\n4 To 6 chopped green onions\n2 Chopped medium tomatoes\n3 tablespoons Olive oil\n1 tablespoon Brown vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Lots of salt 2 Mix together and serve with tortilla chips. It is usually better if made just an hour or so before serving.",
